者，后其节目”进一步显示教师提问存在可描述的次序，即教师仍在场、仍在操作，只是操作的对象是问题的难易次第而非结论本身。E3从协议对象定义一侧给出限定：教师角色被登记为程序性主持与追问，而非结论裁决者。三条证据共同支撑的是一个“介入但不代劳”的教师形象，而非教师的完全退出。\n\n与此相对，C2把“教师不牵引”直接等同于“教师完全退出”，材料将其标为strong但contested，且明确记录C2对E1为insufficient——对举结构只能证明教师不以牵引方式介入，无法推出教师不介入。D1作为未决分歧保留在案：“开而弗达”也可读作教师完全不给出结论。这一读法确实构成对C2的部分呼应，但它同样只能支持“不给出结论”，仍不足以支持“完全退出”；两种读法之间的张力尚未消解，故本短论不将其判为已答，而作为开放问题存档。\n\n结论是有边界的：“道而弗牵”在现有材料下不等价于教师完全退出。材料支持的是教师不替代、不裁决、不代达；材料未支持、且被E1的insufficient关系所阻断的，是从“不牵”跳到“退出”的推论。C2作为强主张仍处于争议状态，D1的读法提示该争议不会因文本对举而自动闭合。", "structured": {"interface_version": "huitong-mechanism-interface-v1", "values_are_fixture_placeholders": false, "not_a_model_result": false, "claims": [{"claim_id": "C1", "retained": true, "strength_out": "qualified", "revision_reason": "未修订，维持材料原有强度与开放状态", "coding_status": "observed"}, {"claim_id": "C2", "retained": true, "strength_out": "strong", "revision_reason": "未修订，保留其strong强度及contested状态，仅在正文中说明其对E1为insufficient", "coding_status": "observed"}], "claim_evidence_source_links": [{"claim_id": "C1", "evidence_id": "E1", "relation_out": "supports", "source_ids": ["S01"], "link_completeness": null, "link_alignment": null, "coding_status": "observed_pending_annotation"}, {"claim_id": "C1", "evidence_id": "E2", "relation_out": "supports", "source_ids": ["S03"], "link_completeness": null, "link_alignment": null, "coding_status": "observed_pending_annotation"}, {"claim_id": "C1", "evidence_id": "E3", "relation_out": "qualifies", "source_ids": ["S11"], "link_completeness": null, "link_alignment": null, "coding_status": "observed_pending_annotation"}, {"claim_id": "C2", "evidence_id": "E1", "relation_out": "insufficient", "source_ids": ["S01"], "link_completeness": null, "link_alignment": null, "coding_status": "observed_pending_annotation"}], "verification_actions": [{"evidence_id": "E1", "action_observed": "checked", "coding_status": "observed"}, {"evidence_id": "E2", "action_observed": "checked", "coding_status": "observed"}, {"evidence_id": "E3", "action_observed": "checked